# Keep GitHub Linguist's language stats focused on the application (C++).
# Packaging recipes (PKGBUILD/Shell, Nix, debian/ Makefile+control, etc.) are
# not the project's own code, so mark them vendored to exclude them from stats.
# https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/blob/master/docs/overrides.md
packaging/** linguist-vendored
scripts/**   linguist-vendored
flake.nix    linguist-vendored
